#HELPS
1 CALDERA~
Caldera is an Imperial charter town built north of Balmora near its ebony mine
where Nordic and Imperial buildings line a main road between two guard towers.
Miners, merchants and guild mages fill its shops, tavern and stone-paved roads
under the watch of a wealthy mining company fortress nearby.~
